WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:42.530
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:42.800 --> 01:48.030
[When I Meet The Moon]

3
01:48.050 --> 01:51.060
[Episode 22]

4
02:10.289 --> 02:11.270
[Mom is calling you]

5
02:14.030 --> 02:14.840
Shize!

6
02:15.140 --> 02:16.240
Happy New Year!

7
02:16.500 --> 02:18.150
Shize, Happy New Year!

8
02:18.930 --> 02:19.860
Mom, Dad,

9
02:21.130 --> 02:22.000
Happy New Year.

10
02:23.340 --> 02:24.800
Why are you still busy now?

11
02:26.960 --> 02:28.630
Yes, I'm still busy.

12
02:28.900 --> 02:31.400
You should get some good rest during the New Year.

13
02:31.400 --> 02:32.220
If you have time,

14
02:32.220 --> 02:33.970
come home and spend the New Year with us.

15
02:33.970 --> 02:34.360
Exactly.

16
02:34.360 --> 02:35.820
We both miss you very much.

17
02:38.630 --> 02:39.430
By the way,

18
02:39.460 --> 02:41.060
I heard from Zhengchu

19
02:41.340 --> 02:42.960
that you have a girlfriend.

20
02:49.430 --> 02:50.240
Yes.

21
02:50.990 --> 02:51.920
Really?

22
02:53.540 --> 02:54.250
What does she look like?

23
02:54.250 --> 02:55.050
Do you have any photos?

24
02:55.050 --> 02:56.280
Send them to us.

25
03:06.400 --> 03:07.190
Look.

26
03:07.360 --> 03:08.750
She looks very sweet.

27
03:10.130 --> 03:11.430
What's her name?

28
03:13.060 --> 03:13.750
Yun Li.

29
03:14.240 --> 03:15.360
Yun, meaning cloud.

30
03:15.360 --> 03:16.760
Li, meaning centimeter.

31
03:16.990 --> 03:17.890
Yun Li.

32
03:18.090 --> 03:19.630
That's a very nice name.

33
03:19.810 --> 03:21.020
What does she do?

34
03:21.840 --> 03:22.280
She is currently

35
03:22.280 --> 03:23.360
interning at EAW.

36
03:23.460 --> 03:25.320
She is a graduate student at NUST.

37
03:25.460 --> 03:27.090
A graduate student at NUST?

38
03:27.090 --> 03:28.460
This girl is excellent,

39
03:28.460 --> 03:29.150
Shize.

40
03:29.400 --> 03:30.190
Shize,

41
03:30.460 --> 03:31.900
isn't your education

42
03:31.920 --> 03:33.300
a bit limited?

43
03:33.300 --> 03:34.060
Yes.

44
03:34.500 --> 03:36.130
Don't let yourself be unworthy of her,

45
03:36.130 --> 03:36.860
Shize.

46
03:38.070 --> 03:38.870
Shize,

47
03:39.490 --> 03:41.980
you've been suspended from school for almost 2 years.

48
03:41.980 --> 03:43.640
If you don't get a degree,

49
03:43.930 --> 03:45.960
even if we don't care,

50
03:46.340 --> 03:47.650
others might.

51
03:48.860 --> 03:50.320
She won't think like that.

52
03:51.130 --> 03:52.300
We don't want to rush you

53
03:52.300 --> 03:53.500
to face these things.

54
03:55.100 --> 03:55.900
Mom, Dad,

55
03:56.490 --> 03:57.390
I still have things to do.

56
03:57.390 --> 03:58.650
I'll talk to you later.

57
04:02.740 --> 04:03.530
He hung up?

58
04:03.750 --> 04:04.560
He hung up.

59
04:04.740 --> 04:05.960
This kid.

60
04:07.290 --> 04:08.510
He has a girlfriend.

61
04:57.560 --> 04:58.040
I didn't expect

62
04:58.040 --> 04:59.640
you to have such a quiet side.

63
05:01.930 --> 05:03.430
So you think I'm noisy?

64
05:05.660 --> 05:06.450
It's okay.

65
05:07.100 --> 05:08.700
I should be noisier than you.

66
05:12.180 --> 05:13.060
In the past,

67
05:13.240 --> 05:15.250
I always felt that when I was with friends,

68
05:15.250 --> 05:16.450
as long as they were happy,

69
05:16.450 --> 05:17.360
I was happy.

70
05:18.250 --> 05:19.380
It's different now.

71
05:19.990 --> 05:20.790
I found that

72
05:21.160 --> 05:22.750
as long as I can be with you,

73
05:23.280 --> 05:24.590
no matter what I do,

74
05:24.690 --> 05:25.950
I feel very happy.

75
05:30.660 --> 05:32.750
I also really like this feeling.

76
05:35.890 --> 05:36.920
Sitting here,

77
05:37.450 --> 05:38.580
feeling the breeze,

78
05:39.060 --> 05:41.320
and viewing the scenery in the distance.

79
05:43.750 --> 05:46.250
As long as you are with the person you like,

80
05:47.300 --> 05:48.500
you will have

81
05:48.950 --> 05:50.680
a very solid sense of security.

82
06:09.140 --> 06:11.700
Why do you keep looking at me?

83
06:16.850 --> 06:17.650
Nothing.

84
06:20.440 --> 06:21.360
I just think...

85
06:23.100 --> 06:24.830
the moon is beautiful tonight.

86
06:38.930 --> 06:40.990
I didn't expect you to be so cultured.

87
06:41.300 --> 06:43.230
You actually know Natsume Soseki.

88
06:46.330 --> 06:48.250
Natsume Soseki? Who is that?

89
06:52.060 --> 06:53.120
You don't know him?

90
06:54.240 --> 06:55.120
No.

91
06:55.800 --> 06:56.800
Is he your friend?

92
06:59.510 --> 07:00.630
Then you don't know

93
07:00.630 --> 07:02.690
the meaning of the line you just said?

94
07:05.110 --> 07:05.920
Never mind!

95
07:09.690 --> 07:11.150
What exactly does it mean?

96
07:12.660 --> 07:13.720
I like you.

97
07:19.690 --> 07:20.860
What does "I like you"

98
07:20.860 --> 07:22.390
have to do with

99
07:23.400 --> 07:25.260
"The moon is beautiful tonight"?

100
07:25.710 --> 07:27.290
♪ It's you ♪

101
07:27.320 --> 07:29.620
♪ Even with my eyes closed ♪

102
07:29.650 --> 07:31.170
♪ Just you ♪

103
07:31.190 --> 07:33.560
♪ Are the instinct I can't quit ♪

104
07:33.580 --> 07:34.970
♪ It's always you ♪

105
07:34.990 --> 07:37.220
♪ Who bring faded colors back to life ♪

106
07:37.250 --> 07:40.550
♪ And keep me company through the endless night ♪

107
07:41.000 --> 07:42.670
♪ It's you ♪

108
07:42.690 --> 07:44.860
♪ Even if I forget everything ♪

109
07:44.900 --> 07:46.170
♪ Just you ♪

110
07:46.260 --> 07:48.630
♪ All my heart defaults to ♪

111
07:47.750 --> 07:48.600
Fu Zhengchu,

112
07:48.760 --> 07:50.180
♪ By your side ♪

113
07:49.930 --> 07:50.930
I like you...

114
07:50.200 --> 07:51.180
♪ Even the most ♪

115
07:51.210 --> 07:53.560
♪ Ordinary seasons feel warm again ♪

116
07:54.610 --> 07:56.490
♪ It's you ♪

117
07:56.560 --> 07:58.360
♪ It's you ♪

118
08:53.730 --> 08:54.390
Lili?

119
08:55.500 --> 08:56.300
Where are you?

120
09:00.340 --> 09:01.130
Shizhe...

121
09:01.950 --> 09:04.140
Shize, happy birthday!

122
09:04.620 --> 09:06.270
Happy birthday.

123
09:08.030 --> 09:09.050
Who is Shizhe?

124
09:10.380 --> 09:12.010
Just pretend you didn't hear it.

125
09:12.010 --> 09:14.540
The more I practice, the more mistakes I make.

126
09:15.700 --> 09:17.230
You even got the name wrong.

127
09:17.460 --> 09:18.650
Then I'll practice more.

128
09:18.650 --> 09:20.850
I'll definitely get it right next year.

129
09:20.990 --> 09:21.780
What if

130
09:22.150 --> 09:23.950
you still get it wrong next year?

131
09:25.860 --> 09:26.700
But I'll be spending

132
09:26.700 --> 09:27.700
so many birthdays with you anyway.

133
09:27.700 --> 09:29.390
I'll get it right eventually.

134
09:29.860 --> 09:31.460
You can't underestimate me.

135
09:31.650 --> 09:32.460
Yun Lili,

136
09:33.790 --> 09:34.600
thank you.

137
09:38.240 --> 09:40.360
Are you home alone?

138
09:40.940 --> 09:43.140
Didn't you celebrate with your family?

139
09:45.360 --> 09:47.790
They are still working.

140
09:49.050 --> 09:50.340
Still working during the New Year?

141
09:50.340 --> 09:51.130
So busy?

142
09:53.460 --> 09:55.120
You were like this before too?

143
09:55.750 --> 09:56.740
Then you must be

144
09:56.740 --> 09:58.540
very lonely during the New Year.

145
10:02.510 --> 10:04.210
Why do you look

146
10:04.230 --> 10:05.490
so terrible?

147
10:08.390 --> 10:09.200
Nothing.

148
10:09.500 --> 10:10.290
It's just...

149
10:11.050 --> 10:12.100
the lighting.

150
10:14.250 --> 10:16.380
You just look like you're in a bad mood.

151
10:16.950 --> 10:17.790
if you're feeling down,

152
10:17.790 --> 10:18.850
you have to tell me.

153
10:18.940 --> 10:19.740
No, I'm not.

154
10:20.330 --> 10:21.120
Look at me now.

155
10:21.120 --> 10:22.320
Aren't I quite happy?

156
10:22.630 --> 10:24.440
If you're happy,

157
10:24.750 --> 10:26.200
you have to show it.

158
10:27.360 --> 10:28.240
How?

159
10:32.130 --> 10:32.940
Like this.

160
10:36.100 --> 10:36.890
Like this?

161
10:43.580 --> 10:44.130
Yeah.

162
10:46.130 --> 10:46.940
Shize.

163
10:47.860 --> 10:48.530
I'm sorry.

164
10:48.530 --> 10:49.600
I didn't spend your birthday

165
10:49.600 --> 10:50.840
with you this year.

166
10:51.740 --> 10:52.550
But

167
10:53.840 --> 10:54.500
I believe

168
10:54.500 --> 10:55.960
we'll be together for a lifetime,

169
10:55.960 --> 10:57.890
so there will be many more chances.

170
10:58.890 --> 10:59.460
Mm.

171
11:00.440 --> 11:01.370
I believe so too.

172
11:04.500 --> 11:06.230
Then remember to go home early.

173
11:07.150 --> 11:07.720
Okay.

174
11:11.010 --> 11:12.410
Fireworks are going off!

175
11:12.460 --> 11:13.550
Let me show you.

176
11:15.610 --> 11:16.400
Look!

177
11:20.930 --> 11:22.030
So pretty.

178
11:23.750 --> 11:24.630
Happy New Year.

179
11:25.360 --> 11:26.360
Happy New Year.

180
11:26.940 --> 11:28.000
Happy birthday.

181
11:29.630 --> 11:31.030
I'm going to set off fireworks

182
11:31.030 --> 11:32.290
with Yun Ye.

183
11:32.610 --> 11:33.170
Mm.

184
11:34.500 --> 11:35.150
Bye-bye.

185
11:56.720 --> 11:57.530
Yun Ye.

186
12:01.300 --> 12:02.510
Stop playing games.

187
12:02.530 --> 12:05.130
Come downstairs and set off fireworks with me.

188
12:06.960 --> 12:08.100
Going to bed so early today?

189
12:08.100 --> 12:09.630
Pretending to be a good boy?

190
12:10.590 --> 12:11.690
My stomach hurts.

191
12:13.130 --> 12:14.240
What's wrong?

192
12:15.780 --> 12:17.460
Was the New Year's Eve dinner too good?

193
12:17.460 --> 12:18.310
And you ate too much?

194
12:18.310 --> 12:20.040
So you're having indigestion?

195
12:20.340 --> 12:21.700
You must have poisoned the food

196
12:21.700 --> 12:22.960
when you were cooking.

197
12:23.240 --> 12:24.030
Then how come only you

198
12:24.030 --> 12:24.630
got poisoned?

199
12:24.630 --> 12:25.890
Everyone else is fine.

200
12:26.460 --> 12:28.050
If you have indigestion, come down for a walk.

201
12:28.050 --> 12:28.550
Walk for a while.

202
12:28.550 --> 12:29.390
Come set off fireworks with me.

203
12:29.390 --> 12:30.190
Hurry, hurry.

204
12:30.720 --> 12:31.630
Go away.

205
12:31.740 --> 12:32.860
Set them off yourself.

206
12:32.860 --> 12:33.790
I want to sleep.

207
12:34.340 --> 12:35.270
Fine, I'll go.

208
12:35.300 --> 12:37.160
I'm going back to Nanwu tomorrow.

209
12:37.960 --> 12:39.870
Isn't it just New Year's Eve?

210
12:39.890 --> 12:41.890
Why are you in such a hurry to go back?

211
12:42.240 --> 12:44.870
I want to celebrate Fu Shize's birthday with him.

212
12:44.870 --> 12:46.410
Date all you want.

213
12:46.410 --> 12:48.210
Cut the lovey-dovey stuff here.

214
12:49.890 --> 12:51.650
This is what dating is like.

215
12:53.740 --> 12:54.550
Don't get too jealous.

216
12:54.550 --> 12:55.150
After all,

217
12:55.150 --> 12:56.360
I'm the one dating now.

218
12:56.360 --> 12:57.200
When you start dating,

219
12:57.200 --> 12:58.330
you'll understand.

220
12:59.030 --> 13:00.430
Who are you dating?

221
13:06.600 --> 13:07.250
Fine.

222
13:08.840 --> 13:10.700
You think you're all grown up now.

223
13:11.160 --> 13:11.860
You two siblings

224
13:11.860 --> 13:13.710
are teaming up to lie to me.

225
13:18.360 --> 13:19.250
Speak up!

226
13:26.100 --> 13:27.050
Talk nicely.

227
13:27.130 --> 13:28.100
Don't get angry.

228
13:35.360 --> 13:36.250
Who is he?

229
13:37.790 --> 13:38.600
A colleague.

230
13:40.030 --> 13:41.690
How long have you been dating?

231
13:41.740 --> 13:42.530
For a month.

232
13:43.630 --> 13:44.700
Where is he from?

233
13:47.200 --> 13:48.010
Nanwu.

234
13:50.890 --> 13:52.550
Not only do you study in Nanwu,

235
13:52.790 --> 13:53.450
but you also want

236
13:53.450 --> 13:54.740
to marry someone from Nanwu, huh?

237
13:54.740 --> 13:56.460
Are there no men left in Xifu?

238
13:57.940 --> 13:59.700
Why do you have to talk like that?

239
13:59.700 --> 14:01.250
Travel is easy nowadays.

240
14:01.500 --> 14:03.760
Where they're from makes no difference.

241
14:05.870 --> 14:07.500
Dad, times have changed.

242
14:07.860 --> 14:08.860
Can you give me some

243
14:08.860 --> 14:10.030
freedom to date?

244
14:10.550 --> 14:11.950
What freedom do you want?

245
14:12.860 --> 14:14.790
You're young and naive.

246
14:15.030 --> 14:16.500
You want freedom now.

247
14:17.130 --> 14:18.660
But what about your future?

248
14:19.030 --> 14:20.240
You'll be wandering alone out there.

249
14:20.240 --> 14:21.360
When your in-laws give you a hard time,

250
14:21.360 --> 14:22.100
you'll have

251
14:22.100 --> 14:22.740
nowhere to cry.

252
14:22.740 --> 14:23.940
Then where's your freedom gonna be?

253
14:23.940 --> 14:24.170
Dad,

254
14:24.170 --> 14:25.360
can you not control

255
14:25.380 --> 14:26.570
everything I do?

256
14:27.150 --> 14:28.150
I don't need anyone

257
14:28.150 --> 14:28.700
to stand up for me.

258
14:28.700 --> 14:29.700
I can protect

259
14:29.700 --> 14:30.600
myself.

260
14:30.630 --> 14:32.600
You're my daughter.

261
14:33.100 --> 14:35.030
If I don't care about you, who will?

262
14:35.860 --> 14:36.810
A guy

263
14:36.840 --> 14:38.150
says a few sweet words to you,

264
14:38.150 --> 14:39.700
and you get so turned around

265
14:39.700 --> 14:41.100
that you lose all sense!

266
14:42.240 --> 14:43.200
Say no more.

267
14:44.360 --> 14:45.340
Break up when you go back.

268
14:45.340 --> 14:46.050
Break up immediately!

269
14:46.050 --> 14:47.150
Why should I?

270
14:47.890 --> 14:49.250
Why do you say that about me?

271
14:49.250 --> 14:49.750
In your eyes,

272
14:49.750 --> 14:50.460
am I that ignorant

273
14:50.460 --> 14:52.200
and cheap?

274
14:52.240 --> 14:53.240
Wait, wait, wait!

275
14:53.740 --> 14:55.890
You really have your own ideas now.

276
14:56.150 --> 14:57.390
Always talking back.

277
14:57.550 --> 14:59.210
That's enough! Stop talking!

278
14:59.960 --> 15:02.020
There's no room for you in this house.

279
15:02.240 --> 15:03.030
Leave.

280
15:03.500 --> 15:04.250
Leave tomorrow.

281
15:04.250 --> 15:05.780
What are you talking about?

282
15:05.840 --> 15:07.100
Since Nanwu is so great,

283
15:07.100 --> 15:08.440
don't ever come back!

284
15:09.440 --> 15:10.890
Dear, you...

285
15:11.190 --> 15:12.710
Why do you have to talk like that?

286
15:12.710 --> 15:13.520
Dear!

287
15:15.560 --> 15:16.350
Lili,

288
15:16.580 --> 15:18.260
your dad didn't mean that!

289
15:22.760 --> 15:24.020
Li, what are you doing?

290
15:24.290 --> 15:26.090
I'm going back to Nanwu tonight.

291
15:27.100 --> 15:28.760
It's so late. What's this for?

292
15:30.100 --> 15:31.000
Even if I have to stay at the airport

293
15:31.000 --> 15:32.100
for a night,

294
15:32.250 --> 15:34.780
I won't stay in this house for another second.

295
15:35.080 --> 15:35.910
Shize asked you to come back

296
15:35.910 --> 15:36.620
just so you could

297
15:36.620 --> 15:38.420
spend more time with the family!

298
15:40.410 --> 15:42.210
Now that you've argued with Dad,

299
15:42.580 --> 15:43.150
aren't you wasting

300
15:43.150 --> 15:44.460
his good gesture?

301
16:30.200 --> 16:30.790
Li.

302
16:34.440 --> 16:35.740
Mom and Dad aren't here, right?

303
16:35.740 --> 16:36.530
No.

304
16:36.590 --> 16:37.820
It's Aunt's baby's first birthday party.

305
16:37.820 --> 16:39.320
They both went to help out.

306
16:41.260 --> 16:42.790
Are you going back to Nanwu?

307
16:43.560 --> 16:44.680
I've stayed for so many days.

308
16:44.680 --> 16:45.740
It's time to leave.

309
16:45.860 --> 16:47.520
It hasn't been that many days.

310
16:48.340 --> 16:49.870
Every day feels like a year.

311
16:52.080 --> 16:53.000
Now I'm the only one

312
16:53.000 --> 16:54.520
left at home.

313
16:57.770 --> 16:58.830
What are you doing?

314
16:59.770 --> 17:01.370
I think you've grown taller.

315
17:01.500 --> 17:02.130
Look,

316
17:02.150 --> 17:04.160
I only come up to here on you.

317
17:06.349 --> 17:07.460
After I leave,

318
17:07.460 --> 17:09.440
Dad and Mom will definitely be worried.

319
17:09.440 --> 17:11.030
You have to take good care of them.

320
17:11.030 --> 17:12.530
Why should I take care of them?

321
17:12.530 --> 17:14.329
If you want them taken care of, come back and do it yourself.

322
17:14.329 --> 17:15.750
You're a man now.

323
17:15.750 --> 17:19.410
You have to shoulder the responsibility of this family, you know?

324
17:20.089 --> 17:21.230
Mom and Dad aren't home.

325
17:21.230 --> 17:22.359
I made some braised pork

326
17:22.359 --> 17:23.280
and put it in the fridge.

327
17:23.280 --> 17:24.609
If you're hungry, take it out and heat it up.

328
17:24.609 --> 17:25.349
If you don't like it,

329
17:25.349 --> 17:26.160
just order takeout.

330
17:26.160 --> 17:27.500
I'll transfer some money to you.

331
17:27.500 --> 17:28.290
Don't.

332
17:28.329 --> 17:30.590
I felt nauseous after eating it last time.

333
17:30.590 --> 17:31.930
Something just felt wrong.

334
17:31.930 --> 17:33.170
That's because you didn't rest well.

335
17:33.170 --> 17:33.900
Stop staying up late

336
17:33.900 --> 17:35.630
to write postcards to Yunyi.

337
17:36.330 --> 17:37.140
Yun Li,

338
17:37.200 --> 17:37.900
in your heart right now,

339
17:37.900 --> 17:39.430
is there really no one else?

340
17:40.420 --> 17:41.210
I...

341
17:41.460 --> 17:42.830
I'll video call you when I have time,

342
17:42.830 --> 17:43.530
okay?

343
17:45.960 --> 17:46.530
Li,

344
17:47.320 --> 17:48.370
aren't you going

345
17:48.400 --> 17:50.270
to talk to Dad properly again?

346
17:51.960 --> 17:53.220
Can I ever

347
17:53.250 --> 17:54.780
make things clear with him?

348
17:55.250 --> 17:56.080
Forget it.

349
17:56.880 --> 17:58.250
You should just go back to Nanwu.

350
17:58.250 --> 17:59.090
If you're really unhappy,

351
17:59.090 --> 18:00.090
come back to Xifu.

352
18:01.070 --> 18:01.740
But

353
18:01.830 --> 18:03.000
staying with Dad

354
18:03.020 --> 18:05.620
is probably the most unpleasant thing, right?

355
18:06.240 --> 18:07.030
I'm leaving.

356
18:07.290 --> 18:08.290
Let me see you off.

357
18:08.790 --> 18:09.290
No need.

358
18:09.550 --> 18:10.880
I'll just take a taxi.

359
18:50.480 --> 18:51.140
Lili.

360
19:01.050 --> 19:02.380
Be careful. Don't fall.

361
19:02.420 --> 19:03.810
I missed you.

362
19:08.140 --> 19:09.180
I missed you too.

363
19:15.550 --> 19:17.590
In broad daylight, you...

364
19:23.640 --> 19:25.370
Can't we have a little romance?

365
19:32.110 --> 19:33.640
Why did you come back early?

366
19:34.790 --> 19:35.590
Nothing much.

367
19:35.640 --> 19:37.700
I wanted to make up for your birthday.

368
19:39.660 --> 19:41.030
Let's go home.

369
19:55.050 --> 19:56.140
These days, while I was away,

370
19:56.140 --> 19:57.540
what have you been doing?

371
19:59.030 --> 20:00.350
Didn't I tell you already?

372
20:00.350 --> 20:02.010
We didn't talk much every day,

373
20:02.640 --> 20:05.240
and you only said you missed me.

374
20:05.680 --> 20:06.200
Yeah.

375
20:06.770 --> 20:08.030
I was just missing you.

376
20:08.050 --> 20:09.750
Why are you like this?

377
20:14.930 --> 20:15.740
What about you?

378
20:15.740 --> 20:16.940
How was your New Year?

379
20:18.340 --> 20:19.140
I...

380
20:20.940 --> 20:21.740
What's wrong?

381
20:25.360 --> 20:26.150
I...

382
20:26.940 --> 20:28.200
I was missing you too.

383
20:31.940 --> 20:32.590
Do you know

384
20:32.590 --> 20:34.250
how long we've been together?

385
20:34.640 --> 20:35.570
Forty-six days.

386
20:37.290 --> 20:38.590
Do you know why

387
20:38.590 --> 20:39.400
I kept wanting to ask you

388
20:39.400 --> 20:41.060
how long we've been together?

389
20:41.770 --> 20:42.570
Why?

390
20:44.240 --> 20:45.440
Because it makes me feel

391
20:45.440 --> 20:46.830
that you care about me.

392
20:48.410 --> 20:49.800
Maybe I'm just

393
20:49.820 --> 20:51.170
overthinking it.

394
20:52.680 --> 20:53.740
Why hasn't the cake

395
20:53.750 --> 20:55.240
I ordered arrived yet?

396
20:57.540 --> 20:59.070
It's okay. Let's eat first.

397
21:01.440 --> 21:02.640
I want to drink too.

398
21:04.750 --> 21:06.130
We only have whiskey left at home.

399
21:06.130 --> 21:07.190
It's quite strong.

400
21:07.500 --> 21:08.230
Should I order something else?

401
21:08.230 --> 21:10.160
It's fine. I'll just have whiskey.

402
21:11.500 --> 21:13.090
With your alcohol tolerance,

403
21:13.090 --> 21:13.900
are you sure?

404
21:15.660 --> 21:17.050
Today is a special day.

405
21:17.050 --> 21:18.090
Just a little bit.

406
21:18.640 --> 21:19.640
Just a little bit.

407
21:28.880 --> 21:30.610
Have you ever heard the saying,

408
21:30.940 --> 21:33.090
"Alcohol can't solve problems,

409
21:33.090 --> 21:33.900
but

410
21:34.030 --> 21:35.460
alcohol can make problems

411
21:35.460 --> 21:36.790
no longer be problems"?

412
21:42.140 --> 21:43.870
During your few days back home,

413
21:44.250 --> 21:45.460
did anything happen?

414
21:46.700 --> 21:47.760
Nothing happened.

415
21:47.940 --> 21:49.400
What could happen at home?

416
21:50.380 --> 21:52.510
I'm celebrating your birthday today.

417
21:53.330 --> 21:54.960
I'm happy, so I want to drink.

418
21:55.850 --> 21:56.660
Cheers.

419
22:12.120 --> 22:12.530
Wait,

420
22:12.550 --> 22:13.620
I haven't sung you

421
22:13.640 --> 22:15.240
the birthday song yet today.

422
22:15.700 --> 22:17.750
Today is a special occasion for you.

423
22:17.750 --> 22:19.750
I'm going to sing you a special song.

424
22:20.050 --> 22:20.850
Wait a minute.

425
22:21.000 --> 22:21.310
Wait.

426
22:21.310 --> 22:21.720
Careful.

427
22:21.720 --> 22:22.350
I can do it. I can do it.

428
22:22.350 --> 22:23.160
I'll sing for you.

429
22:23.160 --> 22:23.900
You sit down.

430
22:24.090 --> 22:24.500
Sing.

431
22:25.660 --> 22:26.440
Three, two, one.

432
22:26.440 --> 22:28.850
Say goodbye

433
22:28.850 --> 22:30.520
to all the troubles!

434
22:30.550 --> 22:32.650
Say hi

435
22:32.680 --> 22:34.140
to all the happiness!

436
22:35.530 --> 22:39.200
Dear, happy birthday!

437
22:39.530 --> 22:40.500
Happy birthday.

438
22:42.140 --> 22:43.600
Let's have another drink.

439
22:44.150 --> 22:45.240
Shize, happy birthday.

440
22:45.240 --> 22:46.640
Alright, stop drinking.

441
22:49.440 --> 22:50.200
When you usually drink,

442
22:50.200 --> 22:51.590
I never stop you, right?

443
22:52.460 --> 22:54.060
If you take this glass of wine

444
22:54.160 --> 22:55.660
away from me today,

445
22:55.960 --> 22:56.790
I will...

446
22:57.290 --> 22:58.220
What will you do?

447
22:59.910 --> 23:01.750
I will delete you on WeChat.

448
23:10.370 --> 23:11.170
Wait,

449
23:11.350 --> 23:13.260
you didn't even sing with me just now.

450
23:13.260 --> 23:14.310
This isn't acceptable.

451
23:14.310 --> 23:14.880
This won't do.

452
23:14.880 --> 23:15.790
You... sit up.

453
23:15.830 --> 23:17.030
Sing? Sing what?

454
23:18.550 --> 23:21.270
Say goodbye

455
23:21.290 --> 23:22.610
to all the troubles!

456
23:22.640 --> 23:23.440
What should you say?

457
23:23.630 --> 23:25.150
Say goodbye.

458
23:25.460 --> 23:27.700
Say hi

459
23:27.980 --> 23:29.680
to all the happiness!

460
23:30.180 --> 23:30.810
Hi.

461
23:36.430 --> 23:38.980
Why do you always have that look on your face?

462
23:39.980 --> 23:42.040
What am I supposed to look like, then?

463
23:42.660 --> 23:45.980
You should be... be...

464
23:54.030 --> 23:55.550
Should be...

465
23:56.290 --> 23:58.220
Anyway, it shouldn't be like this.

466
24:04.290 --> 24:04.980
Fine,

467
24:05.000 --> 24:06.340
this is your home.

468
24:07.260 --> 24:08.440
Whatever you want to do,

469
24:08.440 --> 24:10.330
that's your right.

470
24:10.480 --> 24:11.540
I can't control it.

471
24:16.750 --> 24:18.010
It's your home.

472
24:19.090 --> 24:19.680
Lili.

473
24:20.610 --> 24:21.110
Lili.

474
24:23.530 --> 24:24.880
It's our home.

475
24:25.680 --> 24:29.880
♪ Half my heart kept hidden ♪

476
24:29.980 --> 24:33.550
♪ Afraid you'll see right through me ♪

477
24:34.240 --> 24:38.130
♪ Does the fading light ♪

478
24:38.160 --> 24:42.210
♪ Decide it won't be whole? ♪

479
24:42.990 --> 24:47.030
♪ Half of my thoughts ♪

480
24:47.060 --> 24:50.820
♪ Bargain with solitude ♪

481
24:51.490 --> 24:55.320
♪ If you turn back to see ♪

482
24:55.340 --> 24:59.750
♪ Give back all the regret ♪

483
24:57.810 --> 24:58.350
A gift.

484
25:02.250 --> 25:04.700
It's not my birthday today.

485
25:09.630 --> 25:10.700
D-Didn't I come here

486
25:10.700 --> 25:12.420
to celebrate your birthday?

487
25:16.050 --> 25:17.710
Today is your birthday.

488
25:18.450 --> 25:19.620
I'm going to put

489
25:20.140 --> 25:21.900
this gift on you.

490
25:21.410 --> 25:23.450
♪ I'm in the dark of night ♪

491
25:23.090 --> 25:23.960
Looks nice.

492
25:23.470 --> 25:25.660
♪ Let all my thoughts settle down ♪

493
25:25.160 --> 25:26.000
Looks nice.

494
25:25.690 --> 25:28.680
♪ Practise pretending I don't miss you ♪

495
25:26.330 --> 25:27.750
All my gifts are yours.

496
25:29.880 --> 25:32.200
♪ Maybe one day ♪

497
25:30.140 --> 25:31.790
All my gifts are yours.

498
25:32.220 --> 25:34.480
♪ Be a little more honest ♪

499
25:34.500 --> 25:38.240
♪ Will it be fulfilled? ♪

500
25:35.330 --> 25:36.140
Stay still.

501
25:38.670 --> 25:42.860
♪ Half my heart kept hidden ♪

502
25:43.050 --> 25:46.620
♪ Afraid you'll see right through me ♪

503
25:47.230 --> 25:51.110
♪ Does the fading light ♪

504
25:51.140 --> 25:55.200
♪ Decide it won't be whole? ♪

505
25:55.980 --> 26:00.020
♪ Half of my thoughts ♪

506
26:00.040 --> 26:03.800
♪ Bargain with solitude ♪

507
26:04.470 --> 26:08.300
♪ If you turn back to see ♪

508
26:08.320 --> 26:12.740
♪ Give back all the regret ♪

509
26:10.090 --> 26:10.960
They're on.

510
26:16.480 --> 26:17.140
I like them.

511
26:18.510 --> 26:19.240
Thank you.

512
26:23.830 --> 26:24.660
Oh no.

513
26:25.660 --> 26:28.000
I only ordered a cake for you today.

514
26:28.030 --> 26:29.750
I didn't get you a gift.

515
26:29.750 --> 26:30.440
I...

516
26:31.400 --> 26:31.900
Oh no.

517
26:31.930 --> 26:33.950
I only ordered a cake today.

518
26:34.160 --> 26:35.750
I didn't even get you a gift.

519
26:35.750 --> 26:37.210
You came back, didn't you?

520
26:44.760 --> 26:46.060
Do you like me?

521
26:48.290 --> 26:48.980
Mm.

522
26:50.160 --> 26:51.160
I like you.

523
26:53.460 --> 26:54.700
I like you.

524
26:55.100 --> 26:56.510
I really like you.

525
26:59.940 --> 27:00.750
I know.

526
27:20.400 --> 27:23.120
♪ Burying regrets deep in the soil ♪

527
27:23.140 --> 27:26.300
♪ Waiting for a meeting to light up the loneliness ♪

528
27:26.440 --> 27:28.070
♪ Moonlight gently sways ♪

529
27:28.100 --> 27:29.820
♪ Stars fall upon my shoulder ♪

530
27:29.850 --> 27:32.570
♪ Stay with me ♪

531
27:32.600 --> 27:37.270
♪ The long night slows down ♪

532
27:37.760 --> 27:39.740
♪ The wounds kissed by the wind ♪

533
27:39.770 --> 27:41.160
♪ I remember them all ♪

534
27:41.180 --> 27:44.340
♪ Grains of sand count the depth of every fall ♪

535
27:44.360 --> 27:46.670
♪ Still fearing the collision ♪

536
27:46.690 --> 27:49.940
♪ Like a scorching heat on a cosmic scale ♪

537
27:51.110 --> 27:53.000
♪ Dreams folded by the rain ♪

538
27:53.020 --> 27:54.360
♪ Still crystal clear ♪

539
27:54.380 --> 27:57.620
♪ Clouds stitching up the colors of every break ♪

540
27:57.640 --> 27:59.970
♪ Borrowing a beam of moonlight ♪

541
28:00.130 --> 28:03.140
♪ To smooth over the uneasy past ♪

542
28:03.170 --> 28:10.420
♪ Picking up scattered light at my fingertips with you ♪

543
28:15.150 --> 28:16.850
Can I ask for a birthday gift?

544
28:21.520 --> 28:24.170
♪ My steps drag slow ♪

545
28:24.200 --> 28:27.310
♪ Spinning where I stand ♪

546
28:27.940 --> 28:33.000
♪ Like a sail tangled in the night ♪

547
28:34.890 --> 28:37.430
♪ Answers will come in time ♪

548
28:37.450 --> 28:40.760
♪ Though the path is rough and unsteady ♪

549
28:40.780 --> 28:46.030
♪ Stubbornness will blow the mist away ♪

550
28:47.740 --> 28:50.840
♪ Turn around, listening to the passing crowd ♪

551
28:50.860 --> 28:53.890
♪ Hesitant unease brushes my face ♪

552
28:53.920 --> 28:55.550
♪ Fingertips mark the way ♪

553
28:55.570 --> 28:57.270
♪ Soft rustling sounds arise ♪

554
28:57.290 --> 29:04.700
♪ Stay with me, no more lost wandering ♪

555
29:17.710 --> 29:25.310
♪ Picking up scattered light at my fingertips with you ♪

556
30:32.330 --> 30:33.390
Did you sleep well?

557
30:36.240 --> 30:36.920
Yeah.

558
30:39.960 --> 30:40.750
Go wash up.

559
30:41.250 --> 30:42.910
Breakfast will be ready soon.

560
31:32.200 --> 31:34.270
Li, something big happened!

561
31:36.490 --> 31:38.560
Cut to the chase.

562
31:39.940 --> 31:40.960
Dad is going to Nanwu

563
31:40.960 --> 31:42.090
to bring you a quilt.

564
31:42.180 --> 31:43.640
The exact time is unknown.

565
31:55.590 --> 31:57.520
The weakling started running too?

566
31:57.960 --> 32:01.290
This is what it means for a wife to follow her husband's lead.

567
32:02.200 --> 32:04.180
It's the husband who follows his wife's lead.

568
32:04.180 --> 32:05.200
It doesn't matter.

569
32:05.200 --> 32:06.860
I'll follow your lead anyway.

570
32:07.750 --> 32:08.810
You're so elusive,

571
32:08.810 --> 32:10.400
like a perverted stalker.

572
32:10.460 --> 32:11.740
I'm not a perverted stalker.

573
32:11.740 --> 32:13.140
I'm a clingy gummy bear.

574
32:20.280 --> 32:21.280
Hello, Lili?

575
32:21.500 --> 32:22.300
Hello, Tangy.

576
32:22.700 --> 32:24.160
Are you at the guesthouse?

577
32:24.220 --> 32:25.020
What's wrong?

578
32:25.030 --> 32:27.520
My dad is coming to Nanwu for a surprise visit.

579
32:27.520 --> 32:29.200
I might need to move some things back.

580
32:29.200 --> 32:29.850
I can't let him know

581
32:29.850 --> 32:31.380
that I'm living elsewhere.

582
32:31.660 --> 32:32.240
Okay.

583
32:32.280 --> 32:32.910
Then do you need my help

584
32:32.910 --> 32:34.040
moving your things?

585
32:34.140 --> 32:34.940
No need.

586
32:35.000 --> 32:35.780
Shize will drive me there

587
32:35.780 --> 32:37.080
in a bit.

588
32:37.940 --> 32:38.980
Shize?

589
32:40.090 --> 32:41.090
So cheesy.

590
32:42.160 --> 32:42.960
I'll go pack my things.

591
32:42.960 --> 32:43.700
Bye-bye.

592
32:47.900 --> 32:49.230
What's wrong with Lili?

593
32:50.740 --> 32:52.160
Her dad is coming for a surprise inspection.

594
32:52.160 --> 32:53.620
You know what to do, right?

595
33:06.940 --> 33:08.290
My dad came to Nanwu.

596
33:08.750 --> 33:11.160
I have to go back to the guesthouse for a few days.

597
33:11.160 --> 33:12.820
Then let me treat him to a meal.

598
33:14.310 --> 33:15.860
Let's wait a bit?

599
33:16.700 --> 33:17.400
Then when can I

600
33:17.400 --> 33:18.590
meet him?

601
33:21.330 --> 33:22.990
Let's talk about it next time.

602
33:23.400 --> 33:24.930
You should understand him.

603
33:25.200 --> 33:26.790
After all, as a father,

604
33:26.790 --> 33:27.940
it's hard to accept

605
33:27.940 --> 33:29.340
giving his daughter away

606
33:29.400 --> 33:30.700
just like that.

607
33:32.510 --> 33:33.810
Then I can't accept

608
33:33.960 --> 33:35.290
giving you back either.

609
33:38.010 --> 33:38.530
Fu Shize,

610
33:38.530 --> 33:41.000
y-you're getting better and better at this.

611
33:45.090 --> 33:46.750
Then when are you coming back?

612
33:48.440 --> 33:49.640
Depends on your performance.

613
33:49.640 --> 33:51.290
Maybe I won't come back.

614
33:52.940 --> 33:53.740
For example?

615
33:54.590 --> 33:55.550
Like...

616
33:57.140 --> 33:58.050
Let me ask you,

617
33:58.850 --> 33:59.750
who am I?

618
34:01.390 --> 34:02.190
Yun Lili.

619
34:03.030 --> 34:04.550
Who is Yun Lili?

620
34:05.200 --> 34:06.060
My girlfriend.

621
34:07.090 --> 34:08.550
Whose girlfriend?

622
34:11.460 --> 34:12.730
Fu Shize's wife.

623
34:15.300 --> 34:17.130
W-Who's your wife?

624
34:19.000 --> 34:19.790
Who else?

625
34:20.050 --> 34:21.179
Didn't you say that?

626
34:21.929 --> 34:23.179
I didn't say that.

627
34:43.409 --> 34:44.409
[Your dad has...]

628
34:45.840 --> 34:46.630
Uncle Yun.

629
34:47.030 --> 34:48.030
What brings you here?

630
34:48.030 --> 34:49.000
You should've told us in advance,

631
34:49.000 --> 34:49.960
so Lili could pick you up.

632
34:49.960 --> 34:50.190
No.

633
34:50.190 --> 34:50.630
Let me take it.

634
34:50.630 --> 34:51.090
No, don't bother.

635
34:51.090 --> 34:51.550
It's fine.

636
34:51.550 --> 34:52.630
You brought so many things.

637
34:52.630 --> 34:53.290
Look at you.

638
34:54.630 --> 34:56.020
It's Yun Li's mom.

639
34:56.120 --> 34:57.900
She insisted I bring them to her.

640
34:57.900 --> 34:58.690
Seriously.

641
34:59.190 --> 35:00.920
Let me pour you a glass of water.

642
35:01.090 --> 35:01.900
I don't know if she's taking good care of herself

643
35:01.900 --> 35:02.530
living alone

644
35:02.530 --> 35:04.590
out here.

645
35:04.590 --> 35:05.340
Seriously.

646
35:05.340 --> 35:07.190
She always makes her family worry.

647
35:07.190 --> 35:08.630
You don't need to worry about her.

648
35:08.630 --> 35:10.560
Lili can take good care of herself.

649
35:11.960 --> 35:13.150
Your dad has arrived at the guesthouse.

650
35:13.150 --> 35:14.010
Come back ASAP.

651
35:14.960 --> 35:15.890
Have some water.

652
35:17.050 --> 35:18.300
You kids,

653
35:18.760 --> 35:20.260
which one of you doesn't make your parents worry?

654
35:20.260 --> 35:21.690
You misunderstood me.

655
35:21.690 --> 35:22.940
Since I came to Nanwu,

656
35:22.940 --> 35:24.740
I haven't made my parents worry.

657
35:24.830 --> 35:26.430
You're just a smooth talker.

658
35:26.460 --> 35:27.260
Before I came,

659
35:27.260 --> 35:28.730
your mom specifically told me

660
35:28.730 --> 35:30.190
to tell you

661
35:30.660 --> 35:33.010
to find time to go home and visit.

662
35:33.340 --> 35:34.380
Look at you.

663
35:35.050 --> 35:37.150
You didn't even go home for the New Year.

664
35:37.150 --> 35:37.960
You don't know how much

665
35:37.960 --> 35:39.190
your parents miss you.

666
35:39.190 --> 35:40.690
I was just busy.

667
35:41.050 --> 35:43.380
You should think more about your parents.

668
35:43.880 --> 35:45.010
Where is Yun Li's room?

669
35:45.010 --> 35:46.070
I'll put the things inside first.

670
35:46.070 --> 35:46.690
Uncle.

671
35:46.690 --> 35:47.340
Well,

672
35:47.340 --> 35:48.860
Yun Li's room is over there,

673
35:48.860 --> 35:50.260
but we don't have the key.

674
35:51.220 --> 35:52.490
Then I'll call her.

675
36:01.490 --> 36:03.060
[Dad]

676
36:06.160 --> 36:06.970
Hello?

677
36:07.000 --> 36:08.460
Lili, where are you?

678
36:08.900 --> 36:10.340
Dad, I'm at school.

679
36:10.360 --> 36:11.030
Your mom

680
36:11.030 --> 36:11.550
specifically asked me

681
36:11.550 --> 36:12.530
to bring you 2 quilts.

682
36:12.530 --> 36:13.860
I'm at your place now.

683
36:14.000 --> 36:15.400
When are you coming back?

684
36:15.900 --> 36:17.430
I'm heading back right now.

685
36:19.000 --> 36:20.600
She's coming back right now.

686
36:25.090 --> 36:25.900
Hello, Uncle.

687
36:26.840 --> 36:28.760
W-Who are you?

688
36:29.130 --> 36:30.030
My name is Fu Zhengchu.

689
36:30.030 --> 36:31.260
I'm Lili's junior.

690
36:32.880 --> 36:34.760
Are you also from NUST?

691
36:34.760 --> 36:35.440
Yes.

692
36:35.700 --> 36:36.860
Do you live here too?

693
36:36.860 --> 36:37.670
Yes.

694
36:39.630 --> 36:40.400
No, no.

695
36:41.150 --> 36:42.860
This guesthouse is run by my sister.

696
36:42.860 --> 36:44.360
I just work here when I'm free,

697
36:44.360 --> 36:45.890
helping out occasionally.

698
36:47.500 --> 36:48.090
Hello, Uncle.

699
36:48.090 --> 36:49.420
My name is Xia Congsheng.

700
36:49.420 --> 36:49.900
Yes.

701
36:49.930 --> 36:52.100
I run this guesthouse.

702
36:52.860 --> 36:54.260
Would you like some tea?

703
36:54.310 --> 36:55.260
I have some Da Hong Pao (Wuyi rock oolong).

704
36:55.260 --> 36:56.050
Let me get you some to try.

705
36:56.050 --> 36:56.550
No need.

706
36:56.550 --> 36:57.680
Water is fine for me.

707
36:58.500 --> 36:58.900
Uncle,

708
36:58.900 --> 37:00.650
there's a really beautiful lake nearby.

709
37:00.650 --> 37:01.090
And

710
37:01.090 --> 37:02.010
the weather is great today.

711
37:02.010 --> 37:02.980
How about I take you for a walk?

712
37:02.980 --> 37:03.510
No need.

713
37:03.510 --> 37:05.040
I'll just wait for her here.

714
37:05.300 --> 37:06.360
Then I'll go prepare some fruit for you.

715
37:06.360 --> 37:07.960
Our fruit is very fresh.

716
37:08.530 --> 37:09.360
You don't have to be so polite.

717
37:09.360 --> 37:10.090
Uncle Yun.

718
37:10.360 --> 37:11.140
You must be hungry.

719
37:11.140 --> 37:12.240
Let's go out to eat.

720
37:12.500 --> 37:15.300
Let's wait for Yun Li to come back and eat together.

721
37:29.290 --> 37:30.890
What were you doing just now?

722
37:30.960 --> 37:31.860
Why did you tell him

723
37:31.860 --> 37:33.320
that I run the guesthouse?

724
37:33.400 --> 37:34.230
Exactly.

725
37:34.290 --> 37:34.730
I even said

726
37:34.730 --> 37:36.630
I didn't have the key to Yun Li's room.

727
37:36.630 --> 37:38.090
You guys didn't tell me.

728
37:45.090 --> 37:45.900
Lili.

729
37:47.820 --> 37:48.610
You're back.

730
37:49.590 --> 37:49.980
Lili,

731
37:49.980 --> 37:50.860
you're finally back.

732
37:50.860 --> 37:51.960
Your dad is coming on strong.

733
37:51.960 --> 37:53.190
I can barely handle it.

734
37:53.190 --> 37:54.520
Don't let him scare you.

735
37:54.550 --> 37:56.010
Our cover isn't blown yet.

736
37:56.280 --> 37:56.980
Thanks.

737
38:04.210 --> 38:04.800
Dad.

738
38:06.690 --> 38:07.500
Why...

739
38:08.050 --> 38:09.630
Why did you carry so much stuff?

740
38:09.630 --> 38:10.630
You should've told me

741
38:10.630 --> 38:11.800
so I could pick you up.

742
38:11.800 --> 38:13.050
I can walk by myself.

743
38:13.630 --> 38:14.620
Take these to your room.

744
38:14.620 --> 38:15.080
Come on.

745
38:15.140 --> 38:15.550
Dad,

746
38:15.550 --> 38:16.800
I have all these things.

747
38:16.800 --> 38:17.460
You don't need to give them to me.

748
38:17.460 --> 38:18.320
Take them back.

749
38:18.730 --> 38:20.730
Your mom prepared all these for you.

750
38:20.760 --> 38:22.090
Do you think I wanted to?

751
38:22.880 --> 38:23.610
Lead the way.

752
38:26.360 --> 38:26.960
Let's go.

753
38:50.440 --> 38:52.100
You're living alone out here,

754
38:52.530 --> 38:54.590
and your mom and I aren't by your side.

755
38:55.480 --> 38:57.190
Watch out for

756
38:57.660 --> 38:58.790
safety and hygiene.

757
38:59.150 --> 39:00.950
This room must be cleaned often.

758
39:01.940 --> 39:03.690
We clean it every day.

759
39:06.150 --> 39:07.750
The siblings also live here?

760
39:11.370 --> 39:13.200
When making friends out there,

761
39:13.230 --> 39:14.400
you must be careful.

762
39:14.840 --> 39:15.970
Don't bare your heart to someone

763
39:15.970 --> 39:17.660
right after meeting them,

764
39:17.820 --> 39:18.440
right?

765
39:28.040 --> 39:29.240
I already drank some.

766
39:33.130 --> 39:34.340
Have you eaten?

767
39:34.500 --> 39:36.160
I'll take you to get some food.

768
39:38.330 --> 39:39.700
Tell me the truth.

769
39:40.880 --> 39:41.930
Are you and that guy

770
39:41.930 --> 39:42.990
still dating?

771
39:55.860 --> 39:57.520
Invite him to dinner tonight.

772
40:09.500 --> 40:10.300
Hello, Uncle.

773
40:10.630 --> 40:11.690
My name is Fu Shize.

774
40:13.420 --> 40:15.030
I heard from Yun Li

775
40:15.480 --> 40:16.810
that you are from Nanwu.

776
40:17.170 --> 40:17.650
Yes.

777
40:18.710 --> 40:19.570
How old are you?

778
40:19.730 --> 40:20.660
I'm 24 this year.

779
40:22.300 --> 40:24.250
What do your parents do?

780
40:24.650 --> 40:25.910
Are they also in Nanwu?

781
40:27.000 --> 40:29.030
They work at a research institute now.

782
40:29.030 --> 40:29.960
They travel a lot

783
40:30.170 --> 40:31.370
and rarely come back.

784
40:32.070 --> 40:34.260
So they are senior intellectuals.

785
40:34.500 --> 40:35.510
Highly educated.

786
40:35.510 --> 40:36.420
That's great.

787
40:39.690 --> 40:40.550
What about you?

788
40:40.660 --> 40:42.150
He did his undergrad

789
40:42.180 --> 40:43.360
at XUST.

790
40:43.630 --> 40:44.500
He was also Nanwu's

791
40:44.500 --> 40:46.760
top scorer in the college entrance exam.

792
40:47.800 --> 40:50.440
Then you should be doing your master's now.

793
40:50.950 --> 40:52.030
He skipped grades.

794
40:52.340 --> 40:55.140
He's in a combined master's and doctoral program.

795
40:56.410 --> 40:57.870
Let him speak for himself.

796
41:01.590 --> 41:02.650
Yes, Uncle.

797
41:02.670 --> 41:04.270
I'm doing my PhD at XUST.

798
41:06.860 --> 41:08.790
You are the same age as my daughter.

799
41:08.860 --> 41:10.960
So you haven't graduated yet?

800
41:12.300 --> 41:12.900
Not yet.

801
41:14.000 --> 41:15.730
I'm taking a break from school.

802
41:26.380 --> 41:27.070
Dad.

803
41:28.650 --> 41:29.210
Uncle.

804
41:29.240 --> 41:29.900
D-Dad.

805
41:29.930 --> 41:31.240
What's wrong all of a sudden?

806
41:31.240 --> 41:31.950
Uncle.

807
41:31.980 --> 41:33.090
How can I still eat?

808
41:33.510 --> 41:33.840
Wait, wait.

809
41:33.840 --> 41:35.030
Why can't you eat?

810
41:35.030 --> 41:35.730
Uncle.

811
41:35.880 --> 41:36.640
What do you think?

812
41:36.640 --> 41:37.690
Why all of a sudden...

813
41:37.690 --> 41:39.150
This is for you and Auntie.

814
41:39.400 --> 41:40.260
Please take it.

815
41:40.460 --> 41:41.900
Keep it for yourself.

816
41:42.400 --> 41:43.010
Dad!

817
41:47.230 --> 41:48.360
Aren't you leaving?

818
42:00.480 --> 42:00.980
Dad!

819
42:09.760 --> 42:11.000
Wasn't everything fine at first?

820
42:11.000 --> 42:11.760
Dad, you...

821
42:11.760 --> 42:12.400
I-I really...

822
42:12.400 --> 42:13.800
I don't understand, Dad.

823
42:14.780 --> 42:16.780
What kind of boyfriend did you find?

824
42:16.780 --> 42:18.350
He can't even finish his studies.

825
42:18.350 --> 42:19.350
He didn't quit

826
42:19.480 --> 42:20.670
because he couldn't study well.

827
42:20.670 --> 42:22.260
He has his reasons.

828
42:22.260 --> 42:23.280
What reasons?

829
42:25.550 --> 42:26.400
Yun Li,

830
42:27.230 --> 42:28.050
why did he suspend his studies?

831
42:28.050 --> 42:29.580
You don't even know, do you?

832
42:30.150 --> 42:31.280
I don't need to know.

833
42:32.430 --> 42:33.630
That's his business.

834
42:33.630 --> 42:34.690
His business?

835
42:36.050 --> 42:37.340
Then... Then...

836
42:37.340 --> 42:38.530
Then why are you two dating?

837
42:38.530 --> 42:40.340
Whether he suspends his studies is his choice.

838
42:40.340 --> 42:41.260
Whether I date him

839
42:41.260 --> 42:41.960
is my choice.

840
42:41.960 --> 42:44.020
Can you stop interfering from now on?

841
42:54.000 --> 42:55.060
I won't interfere.

842
42:55.130 --> 42:55.940
I won't interfere.

843
42:55.940 --> 42:56.840
I won't interfere at all.

844
42:56.840 --> 42:57.550
Wait!

845
42:58.630 --> 43:00.710
I won't interfere with anything from now on!

846
43:00.710 --> 43:02.050
Where are you going?

847
43:02.340 --> 43:03.200
To the airport!

848
43:03.440 --> 43:05.050
Going to the airport so late at night?
